# CODEOWNERS
#
# This file defines code ownership for the Waste-IQ repository.
# GitHub will automatically request reviews from the listed owners
# when a pull request modifies the files or directories they own.
#
# Ownership rules follow a "last match wins" precedence — more specific
# patterns at the bottom of this file override broader patterns above.
#
# Syntax:
#   <pattern>    @<owner-or-team> [additional owners...]
#
# Teams:
#   @waste-iq/core-maintainers  — Overall project leads and architects
#   @waste-iq/backend-team      — FastAPI / Python contributors
#   @waste-iq/frontend-team     — React / TypeScript contributors
#   @waste-iq/ui-team           — Design system and component library
#   @waste-iq/db-team           — Database schema and migration experts
#   @waste-iq/devops-team       — CI/CD, Docker, infrastructure
#   @waste-iq/docs-team         — Technical writers and documentation

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Global Fallback
# All files not matched by a more specific pattern require core-maintainer review.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                                   @waste-iq/core-maintainers

